    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Estimate outer- and inner-border growth increments from shell growth geometry and regress whorl separation, contact and overlap against their ratio. Test whether other parameters such as aperture shape and translation improve prediction beyond that ratio.";
